# Test access (ticket 13-a): what an Access Check would answer for one member, asked by a Tenant
# Admin from the console without the Application's client secret. The page is /test-access.html.
# Needs a Tenant Admin access token with an Active Tenant (see http/tenants.http) and the setup in
# http/access-checks.http (an enabled Application with Invoice, a Role, and a Role Assignment).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9800
@tenantToken = paste-tenant-admin-access-token
@membershipId = paste-membership-id
@applicationId = paste-application-id
@userId = paste-that-members-user-id

### The same { allowed, reason, roleId?, permissionId? } an Application would get
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/test-access
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "membershipId": "{{membershipId}}", "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}", "resourceType": "Invoice", "action": "approve" }

### With resource attributes, for Conditions such as { "ownerId": "${user.id}" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/test-access
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "membershipId": "{{membershipId}}",
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "resourceType": "Invoice",
  "action": "read",
  "resource": { "id": "inv-1002", "attributes": { "ownerId": "{{userId}}" } }
}

### 400: an Action outside the Application Schema
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/test-access
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "membershipId": "{{membershipId}}", "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}", "resourceType": "Invoice", "action": "delete" }

### 404: a Membership that isn't in the Active Tenant (or an unknown Application)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/test-access
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "membershipId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}", "resourceType": "Invoice", "action": "approve" }

### Tests aren't Access Checks: nothing new appears here after running the requests above
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/audit-events?eventType=access_check.allowed
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
